* text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不要做换行转换，否则 Windows 下 checkout 会把 PNG/ICO 里的
# 0D 0A 字节序列当换行删掉，图片被静默损坏（原文件只有 * text eol=lf 一条规则）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
